  "problem": "Find ${lim}_{t\\to 5\\pi /2}{v}_{2}(t)\\,=\\,$\n\n                            \n                                    \n                            \n                                        {{field-1}}",
  "worked_solution": "Substituting $t=\\frac{5\\pi }{2}$ directly into the limit, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{lim}_{t\\to 5\\pi /2}{v}_{2}(t) & ={lim}_{t\\to 5\\pi /2}t\\operatorname{cos}\u2061(\\frac{t}{2}) \\\\  & =(\\frac{5\\pi }{2})\\operatorname{cos}\u2061(\\frac{5\\pi }{4}) \\\\  & =\\frac{5\\pi }{2}\\cdot (-\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}) \\\\  & =-\\frac{5\\sqrt{2}\\pi }{4}.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
